### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

###
### Test 1: Book a 2.5kg Order (Should cost 950 VT)
POST http://localhost:1000/api/orders/book?weight=2.5&senderName=Paul

### Test 2: Book a 6kg Order (Should cost 1800 VT)
POST http://localhost:1000/api/orders/book?weight=6&senderName=Mary

### Test 3: Register a Rider
POST http://localhost:1000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Rider",
  "phoneNumber": "5551234",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": "RIDER",
  "vehicleType": "Scooter",
  "isAvailable": true
}